================================================================================
A NOTE ON SOFTWARE FILES
================================================================================

Most of this repository is prose: rules, agent definitions, skills, templates
and documentation. Four files are Python (the installer, two adapters and the
optional embeddings scripts). Creative Commons does not recommend CC licences
for software, and that recommendation is noted here rather than hidden: those
four files carry no patent grant and no warranty disclaimer tuned for code.
They are covered by the same terms as everything else, and if you need
different terms for them specifically, ask.

